# Netlify (and some other static hosts) read this file automatically and
# apply these as real HTTP response headers — delete this file if you're
# not hosting on Netlify; use vercel.json instead for Vercel.
#
# These cover what the <meta> CSP in index.html can't: frame-ancestors
# (clickjacking) doesn't work via <meta>, only via an actual header.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()
